{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/path-cli/src/goldens.rs","issuer":"mailto:bobby-scratch","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-08T21:43:20.380085Z","id":"3f12514a1ace7e73a1cb03e31af1a8cec96dac1b761b820de07d727d0a52104a","body":{"kind":"concern","summary":"No golden for cursor-agent (protobuf transcript store) or opencode (SQLite): the adapters do not parse those stores, so capture-live refuses them. Declared limit under GOLDENS.md rule 6 (coverage)","tags":["coverage","demo","declared-limit","session:claude-code:77642186-b5fe-4a62-9a4f-c01656ed6335"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/path-cli/src/goldens.rs","issuer":"mailto:bobby-scratch","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-08T21:43:20.384819Z","id":"733e84d271a62080c51d5b8b919447d15b6847c3f30d8ef5c98410a9ce7fdf46","body":{"kind":"concern","summary":"Producer pin is strict only when the producing binary is a nix store path; a target/debug build is not reproducible, so it records producer.dirty=true and check prints an info row instead of failing. Demo captures must use the nix-built path","tags":["demo","declared-limit","pins","session:claude-code:77642186-b5fe-4a62-9a4f-c01656ed6335"]}}
